      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Introduction:",
          "_key": "k0007"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0008",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Artificial intelligence (AI) has proven itself as a transformative force, reshaping the way we live and work. ",
          "_key": "k0009"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "The Young, Smart & Local conference",
          "_key": "k0010"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", November 13-15th in New Orleans, is set to host a panel discussion on “AI’s Impact on the Future of Talent,” featuring O3XO’s CIO and Co-founder Mike Gadsby as the moderator. This session will dissect crucial aspects of AI’s practical applications and its unprecedented effects on talent attraction and retention.",
          "_key": "k0011"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://youngsmartandlocal.com/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "About the conference:",
          "_key": "k0013"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The three-day conference is aimed at informing and engaging leaders across various sectors on best practices for talent attraction, growth, and retention. As cities nationwide recognize the pivotal role talent plays in their growth, strategies range from college access initiatives to attracting remote workers. The conference, previously held in Philadelphia and Greensboro, is making its way to New Orleans next week.",
          "_key": "k0015"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "_type": "image",
        "_srcUrl": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/7gH75pnqoo7B9Puj2cpv3QByDfg.png"
      },
      "alt": "Young Smart and Local logo ",
      "_key": "k0016"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0017",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "About the session:",
          "_key": "k0018"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0019",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The spotlight of the event will be the panel discussion titled “AI’s Impact on the Future of Talent,” ",
          "_key": "k0020"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "scheduled from 11:30 am to 1:15 pm at the Camp St. Warehouse.",
          "_key": "k0021"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0022",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The panel includes:",
