        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is an Albert R. Lepage Professor in Business and Executive Director of the Lepage Center for Entrepreneurship at ",
          "_key": "k0031"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
