      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0050",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The “AI’s Impact on the Future of Talent” panel at Young, Smart & Local offers valuable insights into the multifaceted world of artificial intelligence. Attendees can expect a deep dive into the ethical considerations, practical applications, and regional implications of AI, making this session a must-attend for anyone intrigued by the transformative potential of AI in talent management.",
          "_key": "k0051"
        }
      ],
